<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0687_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Kyler</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d like to scrap you again\nsometime. Can we swap\fnumbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! Good looks!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! Oh well!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’d like to scrap you again\nsometime. Can we swap\fnumbers? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You right nearby, but talkin’ on\nthe phone make you feel far.\rDon’t be shy. Why not come talk\nto me in person?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Some people out there\nsay, “You ain’t gotta give Bait to\fyour caught homies,” but\fI’m different.\rMy {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} go HARD.\rSo I feed it good stuff, brush it,\npet it, show it love, and just\fcherish it!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yesterday I went fishin’ and knocked\nout a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}!\rI know if I go to the mountains, or\nthe forest, or the grassland, or the\fcaves, or anywhere like that,\fI could find all kinds of homies.\rBut I just REALLY like homies like\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}, you know...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The biggest homie is always the one\nyou ALMOST caught, you know?\rJust the other day, I almost\ncaught a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} when it\fdipped! I was SO disappointed!\rWhen you fishin’, don’t have no\nregrets! Fish with all your might!\fAyo! Fight!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m sick of fishin’. I’d rather\nscrap you!\rAyo! I’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup? We made plans to meet on\n{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0} for a scrap, right?\fAyo! Hurry up and get here.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0687_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The real draw of fishin’ is you\nnever know what you gon’ catch\ftill you pull it outta the water.\rOne day maybe I’ll pull up on the\nfishin’ Rod and there’ll be a\flegendary homie on the other end of\fmy line...\rYeah, right. The chances of that\nhappenin’ is basically zero.\rLike, RAIKOU and them, while\nthey skippin’ all over the\fplace, maybe they feet slip and\fthey land in the sea...\rWhat you think, could I accidentally\ncatch RAIKOU fishin’?\r...How silly, right?</language>
	</row>
</body>
